WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.411
S R eleven dash seven expects identical inputs to produce identical decisions.

2
00:00:06.433 --> 00:00:10.884
Traditional models honor that. They are deterministic by construction.

3
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:18.871
A I agents are not. The same prompt today and tomorrow can produce different answers — even with temperature pinned to zero.

4
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.351
What breaks is reproducibility-based validation.

5
00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:27.898
The fix is to validate the behavioral envelope, not the exact output.
